<title>USA: Time Warner to make cuts at Atlantic - sources.</title>
<headline>Time Warner to make cuts at Atlantic - sources.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Time Warner Inc is soon expected to announce layoffs of some employees of its Atlantic Group music division, industry sources said Wednesday.</p>
<p>Company officials declined to comment but said a statement would be made later Wednesday.</p>
<p>Industry sources also said the company was planning to consolidate several of Atlantic's labels and to slash several artists from its roster.</p>
</text>
